                                "text": "This trend reflects global urbanization -- studies show that as more people move to cities, they are consuming more seafood -- but it is changing the world's seascape as well. — (Juliet Eilperin, Washington Post : Down on the Farm, More and More Fish, 20 septembre 2009)",
